{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33785","headline":"公斋四咏 鹤屏 · 皮日休","name":"公斋四咏 鹤屏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三幅吹空縠，孰写仙禽状。\n䯔耳侧以听，赤精旷如望。\n引吭看云势，翘足临池样。\n颇似近蓐席，还如入方丈。\n尽日空不鸣，穷年但相向。\n未许子晋乘，难教道林放。\n貌既合羽仪，骨亦符法相。\n愿升君子堂，不必思崑阆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}